{"title":"2011 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(without_finding_function_at_2)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (without finding function at 2)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/3/9f35a41174c6d0799bed8fafffed475b5c50ab61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + g(x) = 3x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c843655e6daa305a70a8a8e7d51a92a7c060da46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) - g(x) = 5x + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<p>for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/19581306a7c3a6f5bf4987c9907ecd687df6a246.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> since we are looking for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/19581306a7c3a6f5bf4987c9907ecd687df6a246.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/271a4874b7ca2caae7201e5f994549a23750fc45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + g(2) = 3 \\times 2 + 5 = 6 + 5 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"294\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed629c05909379718c220b32eca9ee5e89ed7873.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) - g(2) = 5 \\times 2 + 7 = 10 + 7 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"303\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Adding these two equations, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a04dc40db96a27626c43d1c35ecc65ad6b7397c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + g(2) + f(2) - g(2) = 11 + 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"285\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/49451b6b1e50d08eed3deafd2dd40352244a4cd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2) = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a15efffdcf39425ee63aacf5f4b47b53d7d48f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = \\frac{28}{2} = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18da71ec307f0baa6bd0b29fd19eaf192e4937e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" /> into the first equation, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda5f5a8f38d96beb0fc7638f5f0eecb86f67284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 + g(2) = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26f7b8af505f101df657f2da7b9e5b708b98007f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(2) = 11 - 14 = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d25a3d9205ae6c09f0adf0f593cc04f024bfcd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2) = 28 \\times -3 = \\boxed{-84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"233\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding the two equations, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78679c41d91b607320f43c0516985e07f117f65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + g(x) + f(x) - g(x) = 3x + 5 + 5x + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"355\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/5105c3345e549d5a7454ccf198f616e353018429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(x) = 8x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c8452db01cb88c12467f013b8124bab53d52de26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{8x + 12}{2} = 4x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />, we then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a24f6673428ee7ffe690938b25804fc40fe93a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 4 \\times 2 + 6 = 8 + 6 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"239\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/8405a74c9670c78b3b3813d395d7de2ba198e7e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 4x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" /> into the first equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c2441927aac4dbec69776a3e07fbbe81e7665ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x + 6 + g(x) = 3x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/2/0e219d3fc9a12bba1ba65c1fd941a75d98fcde38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = 3x + 5 - 4x - 6 = -x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"264\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69b03b7b63ba9d05d1490353e0dce7c8ac985bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(2) = -2 - 1 = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"161\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f85cd281f615188438bd81cb28e2ebb9d66cc73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2) = 2 \\times 14 \\times -3 = 28 \\times -3 = \\boxed{-84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"352\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28without_finding_function_at_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(without_finding_function_at_2)\">Solution 3 (without finding function at 2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (without finding function at 2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into the equations, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/271a4874b7ca2caae7201e5f994549a23750fc45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + g(2) = 3 \\times 2 + 5 = 6 + 5 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"294\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed629c05909379718c220b32eca9ee5e89ed7873.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) - g(2) = 5 \\times 2 + 7 = 10 + 7 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"303\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We see that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c65ff414eb090a3851656da90b4789365e875cbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(x) + g(x))^{2} = (f(x))^{2} + 2f(x)g(x) + (g(x))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d308f806880e74e0bf37e559a029a6a294ad51f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(x) - g(x))^{2} = (f(x))^{2} - 2f(x)g(x) + (g(x))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting these two, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a1096ac044b77447321e579b80c71ca2077fb03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(x))^{2} + 2f(x)g(x) + (g(x))^{2} - (f(x))^{2} + 2f(x)g(x) - (g(x))^{2} = (f(x) + g(x))^{2} - (f(x) - g(x))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"767\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d1427a16b107a5471f0042b98cb704951e8f0ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(x)g(x) = (f(x) + g(x))^{2} - (f(x) - g(x))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"353\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/b/77be11c1825ec507b5a87218d70b17f29febbdf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(x)g(x) = \\frac{(f(x) + g(x))^{2} - (f(x) - g(x))^{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"357\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b342dcdd5d29b556442812603144ef62eae7a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2) = \\frac{(f(2) + g(2))^{2} - (f(2) - g(2))^{2}}{2} = \\frac{11^{2} - 17^{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"451\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/1999cd92037a833af80a5155f7664d2ab4a0ca74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2) = \\frac{121 - 289}{2} = \\frac{-168}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"252\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/8/508a4fcfc23bf2af185c2f4da95a94de49aa75dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2)g(2) = \\boxed{-84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"145\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017140131\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 202/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8342/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.915      1 2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    8.915      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36065:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017140131 and revision id 279804. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}